        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollowbrook is a horror game that will center around a long-running arc over several episodes. Each episode will spotlight a certain character that you will come to love, each with their own backstories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive your first night in the apartments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hollowbrook - Apartments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story, you play as <strong>Jenny</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just moved in to a new apartment last week and have few acquaintances.<br>One night, during a storm, a series of events unfold that you must successfully navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make the <strong>right choices</strong>, or are you destined for something else?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you will experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven story that builds toward a tense grand finale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted <i>immersive</i> and <i>atmospheric</i> environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and things to explore and discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints for those that don't survive the night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The apartment episode is a shorter episode, expected to last anywhere between 30 to 90 minutes.</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollowbrook is a horror game that will center around a long-running arc over several episodes. Each episode will spotlight a certain character that you will come to love, each with their own backstories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive your first night in the apartments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hollowbrook - Apartments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story, you play as <strong>Jenny</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just moved in to a new apartment last week and have few acquaintances.<br>One night, during a storm, a series of events unfold that you must successfully navigate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you make the <strong>right choices</strong>, or are you destined for something else?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you will experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character-driven story that builds toward a tense grand finale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted <i>immersive</i> and <i>atmospheric</i> environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and things to explore and discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkpoints for those that don't survive the night.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The apartment episode is a shorter episode, expected to last anywhere between 30 to 90 minutes.</i></p>",
